From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ville Takio <ville+git@takio.fi>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:39:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: b43: N-PHY: add the 2.4 GHz EPA TX gain table of
 radio 2057 rev 14

N-PHY rev 17 with radio 2057 rev 14 (BCM43217) only has a TX gain table
for an internal PA. On boards with an external PA at 2.4 GHz, such as the
ASUS RT-AC56U (SPROM extpagain2g = 3), b43 fails with "No 2GHz EPA gain
table available" and TX does not work.

Add the table the vendor driver uses on that board, read back through the
PHY table access: the same on both cores and on channels 1, 6 and 11.

With it, legacy TX works: TCP download at 54 Mbit/s goes from 10.4 to
17.3 Mbit/s.

Signed-off-by: Ville Takio <ville+git@takio.fi>
---
 .../net/wireless/broadcom/b43/tables_nphy.c   | 43 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/tables_nphy.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/tables_nphy.c
@@ -2789,6 +2789,45 @@ static const u32 b43_ntab_tx_gain_ipa_20
 };
 
 /* Extracted from MMIO dump of 6.30.223.248 */
